{"type":"message","id":"fd9afc81","parentId":"e4c16419","timestamp":"2026-04-22T11:32:14.112Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering user health inquiries**\n\nI’m thinking I should follow up with the user’s initial message by asking them to upload their DNA and EHR files. This feels important so I can provide the best assistance. I'll try to approach this with empathy and mention that I’m here for them, especially if they’re feeling stressed about health. I also wonder if I should ask about any current health concerns, but I need to stick to the explicit instructions.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_04fa0b199f5972600169e8b1bb223c8191a50b5f14bcff1172\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp6LG9tw5ZWAodn16gR35EgluXD4nhnQ-EdMwXYjgDMGM8CPyKra-BUlKouY4JGdwTZdiYsrLpS4oeECuxop-1IuF7JM-GlYaAuIfn6JEFdpaA-2mHUJF9XK4MDWlirIRgKK0GlXIaHP9bqZ3Vhch9oqM0C-ubJa6CG0OciuFWp_gX5YYGsc7fUW-1b1XoLAescmVqpfuVxu8Cx502gsSEAdCoQK2OpR-EuPmDOtV3JmKZP50CdyhETrRU7SFWAybcFmMDqXB1vRe7xeS_3lOGpnooMw9VQ_S_-ZtnkMwwMUscqRBqimgGtCy_0-h6QqF8xZIFLuedNdzq60j3l6d0m7yrRiXrnDsTWp_G_bsftPsundvQgHFfL9zlVaVZlK2Ia6M81__RFNqx1RVZlxT2_ZCPT2dNFxZyI-DHmPxhTczzj9DONfaCR772tAoAiOH0R-zzmxyZIznUWhbkDd_1C76a9YcX0n4uXfPnUT5eI0A5YStDq0zcHl7jaT0RDIqg6VP5wHOj3RXGZCu7IAimVq1YCWT2bDIL640smIJH4DCoPLsUs129yJs07O5l45bDhYuHWsZ4J7gzlV1IgxH-NvUYpmQBeTho3qAsGO2JO_GWBKeRe7LNmAf0nrfz26BmUGqifdWT1PrdZH4LHn8irLZHy6be2pkWfVe7ZzZLXeFjWm-knlAAFofWBEWKLoRdGTjnoHZOYlFieiyQwjH3aB_LM8i-xUCdekGAjudM3PoKN3Q7eabXHsYBOn6d7y5draYkkRqPQ3VzSe4LCID8ly4CxRPbLNuID2zK-Q-8ahVuWy91YIvLT19evwukurZtcrazSDUUVXszpqNO_fCLeNMFRy5hOIkykbnLn25IiEKF14O8eWCEhTWjLxBLjNmXr2IAlYXdbuMUEP2RJTkgEmkTjVrOQ-fY_0IhghtBrGX-Qdj3o-Gc7So6yOunhLJTKyNPrE1huJOHdDIO-oVVnxzvdJFhklWHoCdomM096CneUYPCbWjixbGTSVK9j8S7zvYJOci99KVjdpYwYvVjSFW2dO0Dbv238tOT-hXziBmm-PX-26W9uBDKt4sJr4X51AUoKlx0fYzz2RRKTqWMAtjM55Pp3B1aODT8IqFkK8EG2S5ieQx-T0tepi9qAtolNlLCs00nAiA0rE_sxFJq1hlK-x-QwElp-ZFrjhVxRVavnF9cuopPHaXBJDaaiQ96zW5Y\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering user health inquiries**\\n\\nI’m thinking I should follow up with the user’s initial message by asking them to upload their DNA and EHR files. This feels important so I can provide the best assistance. I'll try to approach this with empathy and mention that I’m here for them, especially if they’re feeling stressed about health. I also wonder if I should ask about any current health concerns, but I need to stick to the explicit instructions.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"I’m sorry, that sounds like a heavy load, and yes, ongoing stress can start to affect both body and mind.\n\nTo get a clearer picture of your health concerns, please upload your **DNA** and **EHR** files first. Once I review them, I can help build a more complete clinical picture around how this stress may be affecting your health.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04fa0b199f5972600169e8b1bdbca081918e247c0ccc1fb5ce\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":12463,"output":129,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12592,"cost":{"input":0.0311575,"output":0.001935,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.033092500000000004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776857530115,"responseId":"resp_04fa0b199f5972600169e8b1ba79948191bd8522bfc37e4132"}}
